Error [E0119]: An inferred struct literal needs an expected type
  --> tests/ui/inferred_struct_literal_needs_type.jet:8:10
    |
  8 |     p :: {x: 1}
    |          ^^^^^^
 Why: The `{ ... }` form uses the surrounding type to choose its fields
 Fix: Write the struct name before the braces, like `Point{ x: 1 }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0119
